<title>GERMANY: Conti says EU not to block Michelin venture.</title>
<headline>Conti says EU not to block Michelin venture.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German tyre maker Continenetal AG said on Monday that the European Commission did not intend to block its planned venture with French tyre group Michelin.</p>
<p>&quot;The European Commission in Brussels in an administrative letter said it has concluded its examination of the planned cooperation with Michelin in tyres and sees no reason to block it,&quot; Conti said in a statement.</p>
</text>
